{"id":"661128","name":"年糕炒螃蟹","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661128/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"三眼蟹","amount":"适量"},{"name":"年糕","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"年糕备用。","img":"images/661128/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"三眼蟹处理好洗净。","img":"images/661128/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜片和葱段备用。","img":"images/661128/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"螃蟹均匀沾上一层淀粉。","img":"images/661128/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"沾过淀粉的螃蟹下锅煎。","img":"images/661128/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至金黄。","img":"images/661128/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入姜片翻炒。","img":"images/661128/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把蟹腿和蟹姜一起下锅翻炒。","img":"images/661128/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入年糕片。","img":"images/661128/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐。","img":"images/661128/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/661128/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖5至10分钟左右。","img":"images/661128/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"焖入味后放入葱段收汁即可。","img":"images/661128/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661128/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661128/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}